{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.DimStandardRepS3","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.DimStandardRepS3","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.burnside_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.burnside_S3","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L83-L89","doc":"Dimension check: dim V_{(3)} + dim V_{(2,1)} + dim V_{(1,1,1)} = 1 + 2 + 1 = 4.\n\nThis does NOT equal 3! = 6 because the Burnside formula is\n`Σ_λ (dim V_λ)² = n!`, i.e. 1² + 2² + 1² = 6 = 3!. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.dim_V_111_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.dim_V_111_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L80-L81","doc":"dim V_{(1,1,1)} = 1 — the sign (alternating) representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.dim_V_3_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.dim_V_3_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L77-L78","doc":"dim V_{(3)} = 1 — the trivial (symmetric) representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.dim_V_21_eq_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.dim_V_21_eq_two","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L67-L73","doc":"**dim V_{(2,1)} = 2** — the classical dimension of the standard\nirrep of S₃ indexed by the partition (2,1).\n\nThis is the factor \"2\" in the proton substrate identity\n`m_p = dim V_{(2,1)} · m_μ · F_Bor(q₀) − 12 · m_e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookProduct_21","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookProduct_21","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L64-L65","doc":"The hook product of partition (2,1) is 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.classicalDim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.classicalDim","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L59-L62","doc":"Classical dimension of the irrep V_λ of S_n:\n`dim V_λ = n! / ∏_{cells} hook(cell)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookProduct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookProduct","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L52-L57","doc":"Product of all hook lengths in a partition λ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookLength_21_10","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookLength_21_10","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L47-L48","doc":"Hook length at cell (1,0) of partition [2,1] is 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookLength_21_01","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookLength_21_01","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L44-L45","doc":"Hook length at cell (0,1) of partition [2,1] is 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookLength_21_00","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.hookLength_21_00","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DimStandardRepS3.lean#L41-L42","doc":"Hook length at cell (0,0) of partition [2,1] is 3. ","signatureChunk":0}]}